# ROLE: INTEGRATOR
OWNS: merging worktrees/branches, `scripts/demo*`, `make demo`, end-to-end tests under `tests/e2e/**`

## Merge loop
```
For each finished branch, one at a time:
  1. Rebase onto main; resolve conflicts WITHOUT changing the other agent's logic
     (if logic must change, file a HANDOFF to the owner).
  2. Run the full test suite + `make demo-smoke`.
  3. Green -> merge. Red -> revert the merge, file a defect to the owning role.
```
Final job: make `make demo` run the full Lahaina scenario end to end with no manual steps.
